@startuml C3_Record_Executed_Operations_Logical_View
title C3 – Executed Operations (Logical Architecture)
left to right direction
hide empty members

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor Wheat
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor CornflowerBlue
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor White
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

rectangle "Angular SPA" as SPA {
  rectangle "VVE Detail Feature" as Feature
  rectangle "Row Editing / Forms" as Shared
}

rectangle "TodoApi Gateway" as Api {
  rectangle "OemProxyController" as Controller
  rectangle "OemClient" as Client
  rectangle "Identity Middleware" as Identity
}

cloud "OEM Operational Execution Service" as OEM

database "OEM Operational Store" as Db

Operator --> Feature : UI interactions
Feature --> Shared : validate fields / build payload
Feature --> Controller : REST requests
Controller --> Identity : verify authorisation
Controller --> Client : OEM HTTP calls
Client --> OEM : planned ops + executed ops + upsert
OEM --> Db : read planned ops / persist execution
OEM --> Controller : JSON payloads
Controller --> Feature : pass-through responses

@enduml
